  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "An Immortal Gu hovers in the air, and a lemon colored halo covers Bai Ning Bing’s body and sinks into her aperture, whose walls are densely covered with yellow-green vines. Old Man Yan Shi recalls the Immortal Gu to his own aperture and says he has used everlasting Gu’s ability on her aperture, which will hold for three months before she must return to have it reinforced again. Her primeval essence at a hundred percent presses hard on her aperture, and without Old Man Yan Shi using everlasting Gu to reinforce it, she would not have survived to that day.",
        "chapters": [
          468
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_old_man_yan_shi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan obtains from Feng Jin Huang, in a transaction, a transformation path method for getting rid of the immortal zombie state and reviving. By her words, he would cultivate transformation path and use a transformation path killer move to transform himself into a normal Gu Immortal, then use everlasting Immortal Gu to make that transformation fixed and unchangeable.",
        "chapters": [
          911
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "transformation-path-method",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_feng_jin_huang",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among the revival methods Fang Yuan has collected is one Feng Jin Huang told him in the Starry Sky grotto-heaven fragment world: transformation path theory combined with everlasting Gu to achieve a permanent transformation, which is the same as revival. Fang Yuan does not know how to refine everlasting Gu, and if someone else held everlasting Immortal Gu the situation would be even worse.",
        "chapters": [
          938
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "revival-method",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Speaking to Lang Ya land spirit, Fang Yuan says his hairy man transformation is still incomplete because he has change form Immortal Gu but lacks everlasting Immortal Gu. He says that with everlasting Immortal Gu he could transform completely into a hairy man and truly become a member of Lang Ya Sect.",
        "chapters": [
          1081
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "complete-transformation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "gu_change_form_immortal_gu",
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
